    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="F_pra_abs" name="fraction absorbed pravastatin (fasted)" value="0.217463051507184" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Fraction of the pravastatin leaving the intestinal lumen which is
absorbed via OATP2B1, <code>F_pra_abs * f_OATP2B1 * f_absorption</code>; the rest
is excreted with the feces. It applies to the dose and to every pass of
the enterohepatic circulation. The oral absorption of 14C-pravastatin
is about 34 % (Singhvi1990).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
